- interactivity_usability: 5/5
- faithfulness: 4/5
- label_quality: 4/5
- concept_accuracy: 5/5
- notes: Faithful, well-labelled reproduction of both the acute and obtuse altitude constructions with a rich, genuinely pedagogical set of interactions (apex slider, case selector, altitude/shading toggles, 7-step player, clickable side/arc popups); main weaknesses are the default vertical stacking instead of the source's side-by-side layout and some oversized/offset angle-arc and label styling in the obtuse panel.

